  "title": "GARVEE Rugs for Living Room, Bedroom, Dining & Patio Decor",
  "canonical": "https://www.garvee.com/collections/rugs",
  "description": "Find GARVEE Garvee Washable Rugs by product type, including Floral & Paisley Rugs and Persian Rugs. Discover more at GARVEE.",
